<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - PhoneStore 3D XML</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
        /* Public Storefront Navbar Specific Styles */
        .user-header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 50;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-0) 85%, transparent);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 14px 32px;
        }

        .user-nav-wrap {
            max-width: 1360px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .user-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .user-menu-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 28px;
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .user-menu-links a {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .user-menu-links a:hover, .user-menu-links a.active {
            color: var(--primary-2);
        }

        .user-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .role-switch-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(108, 107, 245, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(108, 107, 245, 0.3);
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 99px;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary-2);
        }

        .role-switch-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F0596B, #E0231C);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 99px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(240, 89, 107, 0.35);
            transition: transform 0.15s ease;
        }
        .role-switch-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .user-footer {
            background: var(--bg-1);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 48px 32px 24px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            max-width: 1360px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.5fr repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .footer-col ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .footer-col a {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--text); }

        .footer-bottom {
            max-width: 1360px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-faint);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- ================= PUBLIC USER HEADER ================= -->
    <header class="user-header">
        <div class="user-nav-wrap">
            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="user-brand">
                <div class="brand-mark">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2.4"/>
                        <line x1="11" y1="18.3" x2="13" y2="18.3"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="brand-text" style="font-size: 18px;">PhoneStore <span style="color: var(--primary-2);">3D</span></div>
                    <div class="brand-sub">Storefront XML 2026</div>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- Navigation Links -->
            <ul class="user-menu-links">
                <li>
                    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="@(ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() == "Home" ? "active" : "")">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> Trang Chủ
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a asp-controller="DienThoai" asp-action="Index" class="@(ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() == "DienThoai" ? "active" : "")">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen-button"></i> Danh Mục Điện Thoại
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a asp-controller="HoaDon" asp-action="Create">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i> Mua Hàng POS
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a asp-controller="DienThoai" asp-action="XsltView">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> XSLT Catalog
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Actions & Role Switcher -->
            <div class="user-actions">
                <!-- Role Switcher Pill -->
                <div class="role-switch-pill">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i> Chế độ: <b>Khách Hàng</b>
                </div>

                <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="SwitchRole" asp-route-role="Admin" class="role-switch-btn" title="Chuyển sang Giao diện Quản trị Admin">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Sang Admin View
                </a>

                <!-- Theme Toggle -->
                <button class="icon-btn" id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Đổi giao diện sáng/tối" title="Đổi giao diện sáng/tối">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.5"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.5M12 19v2.5M4.2 4.2l1.8 1.8M18 18l1.8 1.8M2.5 12H5M19 12h2.5M4.2 19.8L6 18M18 6l1.8-1.8"/></svg>
                </button>

                <!-- Auth State -->
                @if (Context.Session.GetString("IsLoggedIn") == "true")
                {
                    <div class="profile-pill">
                        <div class="avatar">@Context.Session.GetString("Username")?.Substring(0, 2).ToUpper()</div>
                        <div class="who"><b>@Context.Session.GetString("Username")</b><small>@Context.Session.GetString("Role")</small></div>
                    </div>
                    <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" title="Đăng xuất">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket"></i>
                    </a>
                }
                else
                {
                    <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login" class="btn btn-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-to-bracket"></i> Đăng Nhập
                    </a>
                    <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                        Đăng Ký
                    </a>
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ================= MAIN STOREFRONT VIEW ================= -->
    <main role="main" class="view">
        @if (TempData["SuccessMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="validate-line v-ok mb-4" style="border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.3 2.3 4.7-5.6"/></svg>
                <div><b>Thành công!</b><span>@TempData["SuccessMessage"]</span></div>
            </div>
        }
        @if (TempData["ErrorMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="validate-line v-err mb-4" style="border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/><path d="M10.3 3.8L2.8 17a1.6 1.6 0 0 0 1.4 2.4h15.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 0 1.4-2.4L13.7 3.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 0-2.8 0z"/></svg>
                <div><b>Thông báo:</b><span>@TempData["ErrorMessage"]</span></div>
            </div>
        }

        @RenderBody()
    </main>

    <!-- ================= STOREFRONT FOOTER ================= -->
    <footer class="user-footer">
        <div class="footer-grid">
            <div class="footer-col">
                <div class="user-brand" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
                    <div class="brand-mark">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2.4"/><line x1="11" y1="18.3" x2="13" y2="18.3"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="brand-text" style="font-size: 18px;">PhoneStore 3D</div>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
                    Hệ thống bán lẻ điện thoại di động công nghệ cao với trải nghiệm mô phỏng 3D hiện đại. Quản lý toàn bộ dữ liệu danh mục & hóa đơn trên nền tảng XML.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Sản Phẩm Hot</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">iPhone 16 Pro Max</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Xiaomi 14 Ultra</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Nothing Phone (2a)</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Hỗ Trợ Khách Hàng</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Tra cứu bảo hành XML</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Chính sách đổi trả 30 ngày</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Hướng dẫn mua hàng POS</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Trung tâm hỗ trợ 24/7</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Chế Độ Hệ Thống</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="SwitchRole" asp-route-role="User">Khách Hàng View</a></li>
                    <li><a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="SwitchRole" asp-route-role="Admin">Admin View (Bảng Quản Trị)</a></li>
                    <li><a asp-controller="DienThoai" asp-action="Manage">Quản Lý Kho XML (CRUD)</a></li>
                    <li><a asp-controller="ThongKe" asp-action="Index">Báo Cáo Doanh Thu</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <div>© 2026 PhoneStore 3D. Tất cả quyền được bảo lưu. Công nghệ XML / XSD / XSLT.</div>
            <div>Hệ thống Quản lý Bán Điện thoại Di động</div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
